            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "KFlo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Easy and delicious. Didn't have condensed milk, so I used Goya coconut milk. I also added tequila and it was the best margarita ever!!",
            "datePublished": "2023-07-03T13:49:57.478Z"
          },
          {
