              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "hooptee_doo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Amazing!! Perfect as is, also great if you sub out the water with coconut water, and adding cream of coconut in it too! Absolutely recommend this...we had it for taco night :)",
            "datePublished": "2024-02-20T19:23:41.222Z"
          },
          {
