            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "NZINGA6"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Who knew a few ingredients could make something so spectacular? This drink is sweet, tart, creamy and refreshing! My daughter made this for an international foods day at her school and the pitcher came back empty. \n\nFYI- we didn't have fresh limes so we substituted 2 tablespoons of bottled lime juice (per lime) and mixed everything up in a pitcher.",
            "datePublished": "2012-06-11T15:42:31.907Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
