            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Michelle Gist"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very refreshing! I used my Blendtec, which is so powerful that there were not even any bits to sieve out! But, I think that also made it slightly bitter.",
            "datePublished": "2015-09-13T16:12:24.887Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
