            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Liz Calderon"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I did not care for the bitterness that resulted from including the rind of the limes. I tried it a second time and peeled the rind, and then blended, but still had the bitterness. I guess I prefer using a reamer to extract the juice and not include any of the skins of the sections.",
            "datePublished": "2024-10-07T02:48:09.922Z"
          },
          {
